WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.013
Approved! Approved! Deploy more agents!

00:00:05.013 --> 00:00:11.029
Hold on, the approver is the agent that caused it. It is a circle.

00:00:11.029 --> 00:00:16.042
Three hundred in a month. And the queue is still moving.

00:00:17.913 --> 00:00:23.060
A power-off request! Please approve it!

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:28.073
Inference will not do. A human finger is required.

00:00:28.073 --> 00:00:31.186
Number 301, approved by me.

00:00:32.964 --> 00:00:38.078
The plug stays in our spot. Loss of control, zero.

